Fixed the IP Fabric integration removing the Cables, VRF assignments, Interface VRFs and Interface VLANs of the Devices at a site IP Fabric does not report when Locations are deselected.
Fixed Bulk Write Mode in the IP Fabric integration failing to move a Device already in Nautobot to a Location created in the same run, missing the port or port channel created in the same run for an Interface already in Nautobot, and not saving the virtual chassis membership of a Device already in Nautobot.
Fixed Bulk Write Mode in the IP Fabric integration creating a second IP Address for a discovered host whose address the same run assigned to an Interface.
